# URL hosts allowed inside the shipped app (QA-R60, PLT-R906). The site and appcast host comes from
# scripts/brand.env and is always allowed. Adding a host needs a decision record and a /rieng-tu
# update in the same PR. One host per line; "*.example.org" allows subdomains.

# GitHub: repository, issue forms opened in the browser by "Open GitHub issue" (PLT-R1205).
github.com
# GitHub release asset hosts, only relevant if Pa chooses GitHub Releases for archives (PLT-R906,
# spec/02-platform.md section 14 item 4). Keep while that option exists in scripts/publish-release.
objects.githubusercontent.com
release-assets.githubusercontent.com
# Mail link domain for the support address (QA-R51; address still VERIFY).
kal.vn

# Identifiers that are never contacted: XML namespaces and DTD URIs inside property lists and the
# Sparkle framework's appcast parser. VERIFY this list against the first real Release build.
www.apple.com
apple.com
www.w3.org
www.andymatuschak.org
sparkle-project.org
purl.org
ns.adobe.com
